# 🚗 Toyota Multimedia OS — Universal Cross-Platform Guide

Toyota Multimedia OS is a responsive, hardware-accelerated in-car infotainment dashboard and digital instrument cluster. It dynamically scales across **Desktop/Laptop PCs (Linux / Windows)**, **Android Smartphones (Samsung, Pixel, etc.)**, and **In-Car Android Head Units / Tablets**.

---

## 📱 Platform Matrix & Requirements

| Platform | Recommended Environment | Key Capabilities |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Linux (Ubuntu/Debian)** | Node.js 18+, Chrome, Firefox | Development host, MOBAC tile generation, APK compiling |
| **Windows 10 / 11** | Node.js 18+, Chrome, Edge | Development host, local testing, MOBAC tile generation |
| **Android Smartphone** | Android 8.0+, Chrome / Native APK | Hardware GPS tracking, touch dialer, portable head unit |
| **In-Car Head Unit / Tablet** | Landscape Android 9.0+, Native APK | Fullscreen cluster HUD, dual-pane nav radar & soundstage |

